.TH "libnvme_privsep_free" 9 "libnvme_privsep_free" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
libnvme_privsep_free \- Stop the privilege separation helper
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" libnvme_privsep_free
.BI "(struct libnvme_privsep *ps "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "ps" 12
Helper channel
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Closes the channel and waits for the helper to exit. All transport
handles opened through the helper must be closed before.
